{"ref":"BDB, מַשְׁקֶה³","hw":"מַשְׁקֶה³","html":"† II. <big><span dir=\"rtl\">מַשְׁקֶה</span></big>  <strong>n.m.</strong> <a data-ref=\"Leviticus 11:34\" href=\"/Leviticus.11.34\">Lv 11:34</a> <strong>irrigation, drink</strong>;—abs. <span dir=\"rtl\">מ׳</span> <a data-ref=\"Genesis 13:10\" href=\"/Genesis.13.10\">Gn 13:10</a> <a data-ref=\"Leviticus 11:34\" href=\"/Leviticus.11.34\">Lv 11:34</a>, cstr. <span dir=\"rtl\">מַשְׁקֵה</span> <a data-ref=\"I Kings 10:21\" href=\"/I_Kings.10.21\">1 K 10:21</a> + 3 times; sf. <span dir=\"rtl\">מַשְׁקֵ֫הוּ</span> <a data-ref=\"Genesis 40:21\" href=\"/Genesis.40.21\">Gn 40:21</a>;—<br><strong>1.</strong>  <em>irrigation</em> <a data-ref=\"Genesis 13:10\" href=\"/Genesis.13.10\">Gn 13:10</a> (J; abstr. for concrete, =) <em>well-irrigated</em>, of land; <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 45:15\" href=\"/Ezekiel.45.15\">Ez 45:15</a> (< 𝔊 Co Siegf Berthol Toy Krae <span dir=\"rtl\">מִשְׁפְּחוֹת</span>; Gr <span dir=\"rtl\">מִקְנֵה</span>).<br><strong>2.</strong>  <em>drink</em> <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 32:6\" href=\"/Isaiah.32.6\">Is 32:6</a>; <a data-ref=\"Leviticus 11:34\" href=\"/Leviticus.11.34\">Lv 11:34</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">כְּלֵי מ׳</span> <em>drinking-vessels</em> <a data-ref=\"I Kings 10:21\" href=\"/I_Kings.10.21\">1 K 10:21</a> = <a data-ref=\"II Chronicles 9:20\" href=\"/II_Chronicles.9.20\">2 Ch 9:20</a>.<br><strong>3.</strong>  = office of butler, <em>butlership</em> <a data-ref=\"Genesis 40:21\" href=\"/Genesis.40.21\">Gn 40:21</a> (E).","next":"BDB, שָׁקַט","prev":"BDB, מַשְׁקֶה²"}